stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OFFLINE
    OFFLINE --> AVAILABLE
    OFFLINE --> PAUSED
    AVAILABLE --> RESERVED: claim (CAS)
    AVAILABLE --> PAUSED
    AVAILABLE --> OFFLINE: heartbeat lost
    RESERVED --> DIALING: call initiated
    RESERVED --> AVAILABLE: lease expired / call cancelled
    RESERVED --> OFFLINE: heartbeat lost
    DIALING --> CONNECTED: call answered
    DIALING --> AVAILABLE: call failed before answer
    DIALING --> WRAP_UP: call ended
    DIALING --> OFFLINE: heartbeat lost
    CONNECTED --> WRAP_UP: call completed
    CONNECTED --> OFFLINE: heartbeat lost (call ends as AGENT_LOST)
    WRAP_UP --> AVAILABLE: wrap-up timer
    WRAP_UP --> PAUSED
    WRAP_UP --> OFFLINE: heartbeat lost
    PAUSED --> AVAILABLE
    PAUSED --> OFFLINE
